<alcuin. carm. 25.1>	Salve, Roma potens, mundi decus, inclyta mater,
<alcuin. carm. 25.2>	Atque tui tecum valeant in secula nati;
<alcuin. carm. 25.3>	Et caput orbis, honor magnus, Leo papa valeto.
<alcuin. carm. 25.4>	Tu quoque iustitiae sceptrum, lux sedis, honoris
<alcuin. carm. 25.5>	Perpetuis valeas, Christo donante, triumphis:
<alcuin. carm. 25.6>	Claviger aetherius, doctor simul inclytus orbis,
<alcuin. carm. 25.7>	Te precibus pariter conservet semper ubique,
<alcuin. carm. 25.8>	Et quos Roma tenet circum sua moenia, sancti
<alcuin. carm. 25.9>	Vos precibus pariter sanctis tueantur ubique.
<alcuin. carm. 25.10>	O patres, populus, Romanae gloria gentis,
<alcuin. carm. 25.11>	Semper in aeternum domino miserante valete.
